#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""FS3 v213 - effects, part 1: soft light, beams, charge, stars (Silvio, 10.10.2026).

    Glow       Every glow is a soft pre-rendered sprite with additive light
               (glowAt, new src/61_glow.js) instead of stacked filled circles
               and ellipses with visible rims: bolts, sparks, debris glow,
               muzzle flashes.
    Beams      A soft cross section (white core, coloured sheath, faint
               halo) with bands of light running from the turret outward;
               the turret orb is layered soft glow with a thin flare.
    Charge     Light round a charging turret is drawn in, slowly at first
               and ever faster, as streaks that follow the turret.
    Stars      Three painted layers of sharp points with a faint halo,
               moving with the camera, drawn behind planets and suns.

Needs v212. Edits src/20_render.js, 50_combat.js, 57_turrets.js,
60_effects.js, 70_ui.js and the test fieldsim.js; new src/61_glow.js.
Run assemble.py 213 afterwards.
"""
